4. Core Hit Ratio Metrics

◦ Buffer Cache Hit Ratio: [XX%] (Ideal ≥ 90%, expand SGA or optimize SQL if too low)

◦ Library Cache Hit Ratio: [XX%] (Ideal ≥ 95%, reduce hard parses or adjust shared pool if too low)

◦ Parse Hit Ratio: [XX%] (Ideal ≥ 90%, high hard parse ratio consumes extra CPU)

