2. Optimize SQL ID [XXX] statement: replace SELECT *, adjust WHERE condition filtering logic

3. Release lock resources of [XXX Table], adjust business concurrency execution logic to avoid lock waits

Medium Priority (Promote in Short Term, Implement within 1-2 Weeks)

1. Adjust Instance Parameters: [e.g., Increase sga_target to XX GB, adjust cursor_sharing to reduce hard parses]

2. Rebuild [XXX Invalid Indexes], update statistics of core tables (exec dbms_stats.gather_table_stats)

3. Clean up historical data of [XXX Table] to reduce data volume and improve query efficiency

Low Priority (Long-term Planning, Continuous Optimization)

1. Design partitioning for hot large tables (e.g., time-based partitioning)

2. Evaluate database read-write separation architecture to share query load

3. Establish SQL monitoring mechanism to regularly screen inefficient SQL

9.  Follow-up Plan

